meta {
  name: Offline Order
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{PRIVATE_BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/orders/offline
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
  Idempotency-Key: offline-demo-1
}

body:json {
  {
    "customer_name": "Karim Uddin",
    "phone": "01800000000",
    "email": "",
    "district": "Dhaka",
    "area": "Gulshan",
    "address": "House 4, Road 12, Gulshan",
    "notes": "Counter sale",
    "items": [
      { "product_id": "{{PRODUCT_ID}}", "quantity": 1, "unit_price": 500 }
    ],
    "manual_discount": 50,
    "delivery_charge": 0,
    "payment_method": "cash",
    "paid_amount": 200
  }
}

docs {
  # POST /api/v1/admin/orders/offline

  Editor or superadmin. Requires `Idempotency-Key` (8–80 letters, digits, `_`, `-`). The same key returns the original order.

  Omit `unit_price` to use the current selling price, including quantity tiers. Set it to charge that whole-taka price times quantity. Omit `delivery_charge` to use the zone fee. The server computes `subtotal`, `total`, and `due_amount`. `paid_amount` cannot exceed the total.

  `payment_method` is `cash`, `bkash`, `nagad`, `card`, or `due`. Stock is deducted. No customer notification, Telegram new-order alert, Meta CAPI, or GA event is sent.

  422 when stock is short, the discount is larger than the merchandise, or the paid amount is over the total. 409 when the idempotency key belongs to someone else.
}
